{"strongs": "H5439", "word": "סָבִיב", "translit": "sa.viv", "root": "סביב", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "substantive", "gloss": "circuit, round about", "definition": "סָבִיב 336 substantive , used mostly as adverb and preposition , circuit, round about : — construct סְבִיב Amos 3:11 plural construct סְבִיבֵי Jer 32:44 ; Jer 33:13 , suffix סְבִיבֶיךָ etc. (10 t.), much oftener סְבִיבוֺת Exod 7:24 + 22 t., סְבִיבוֺתַי , תֶיךָ -, etc., Deut 17:14 , etc. (48 t.): — 1. in singular — \\ \\ a. as substantive 1Chr 11:8 מןהֿמלוא וְעַדהַֿסָּבִיב and to the parts round about . \\ \\ b. as adverb accusative סָבִיב (in) a circuit , i.e. round about , Gen 23:17 בְּכָלגְּֿבֻלוֺ סָבִיב Exod 19:12 ; Exod 25:11 ; Exod 25:24 ; Exod 25:25 ; Lev 1:5 ; Lev 1:11 עַל הַמִּזְבֵּחַ סָבִיב , Judg 20:29 ; 1Kgs 3:1 ; 1Kgs 5:11 ; Ps 3:7 שָׁתוּ עָלָ֑י ׳ אֲשֶׁר ס , Ps 12:9 ; Ps 34:8 + often; sometimes doubled, for the sake of emphasis, 2Chr 4:3 ; Ezek 8:10 ׳ ס ׳ עַל הַקִּיר ס , Ezek 37:2 ; Ezek 40:5 and often in Ezek 40-43. \\ \\ c. as preposition : \\ \\ \\ ( a ) Psalms, Amos 3:11 צַר וּסְבִיב הָאָרֶץ distress , and that in the circuit of (= round about ) the land (but read probably with ᵑ6 יְסֹבֵב will encircle ). \\ \\ \\ ( b ) ׳ סָבִיב לְ Exod 16:13 ; Exod 40:33 ; Num 1:50 ; Num 1:53 ; Num 2:2 ; Judg 7:21 ; 1Kgs 6:5 ; 1Kgs 18:32 ; 1Kgs 18:35 ; Ezek 41:10 ; Ezek 14:16 ; Job 19:12 ; Ps 34:8 ; Ps 78:28 ; Ps 125:2 (twice in verse) סָבִיב לְעַמּוֺ ׳ י , Ps 128:3 ; Song 3:7 ; Nah 3:8 . \\ \\ \\ ( c ) strangely, סָבִיב אֵת 1Kgs 6:5 (omitted by ᵐ5 ), Ezek 43:17 . \\ \\ d. מִסָּבִיב 42 , from round about, from every side , Ezek 16:33 ; Ezek 16:37 ; Ezek 23:22 ; Ezek 37:21 , but usually ( מִן 1 c ) = on every side , Jer 4:17 הָיוּ עָלֶיהָ מִסָּבִיב , Isa 42:25 ׳ וַתְּלַהֲטֵהוּ מ , Joel 4:11 ; Joel 4:12 Psalms מָגוֺר מִסָּבִיב terror on every side ! Jer 6:25 ; Jer 20:3 ; Jer 20:10 ; Jer 46:5 ; Jer 49:29 ; Ps 31:14 , compare Lam 2:22 especially in the Deuteronomic phrases ׳ אוֺיְבִים מ , or ׳ הֵנִיחַ מ (sometimes in combination), as Deut 12:10 ׳ והניח לכם מכלאֿויביכם מ , Deut 25:19 ; Josh 21:42 ׳ לָהֶם מ ׳ וַיָּנַח י , Josh 23:1 ; Judg 2:14 ; Judg 8:34 ; 1Sam 12:11 +; מִסָּבִיב לְ from round about , Num 16:24 ; Num 16:27 . — On 1Sam 14:21 ; 2Sam 24:6 ; Job 10:8 see סָבַב . 2. In plur.: — \\ \\ a. סְבִיבִים : \\ \\ \\ ( a ) in masculine sense, those round about , Ps 76:12 כָּלסְֿבִיבָיו יֹבִילוּ שַׁי , Ps 89:8 ; Jer 48:17 ; Jer 48:39 . \\ \\ \\ ( b ) in neuter sense, the parts round about , Jer 49:5 מִכָּלסְֿבִיבָ֑יִךְ , בִּסְבִיבֵי ירושׁלם Jer 32:44 ; Jer 33:13 ; Jer 21:14 וְאָֽכְלָה כָּלסְֿבִיבֶיהָ , Jer 46:14 with the force of a perp. , Ps 50:3 וסביביו נשׂערה מאד , Ps 97:2 ; Lam 1:17 . \\ \\ b. סְבִיבוֺת \\ \\ \\ ( a ) as substantive ( α ) circuits , Eccl 1:6 ועל סביבותיו שָׁב הָרוּחַ ; ( β ) the parts round about , Num 22:4 ילחכו הקהל אתכֿלסְֿבִיבֹתֵינוּ , Jer 17:26 ; Jer 50:32 (compare Jer 21:14 above); with reference to their inhabitants, Ps 44:19 = Ps 79:4 ׳ לעג וקלס לסב , Ezek 16:57 ; Ezek 28:24 ; Dan 9:16 . \\ \\ \\ ( b ) with the force a preposition Exod 7:24 סְבִיבֹת הַיְאֹר literally (in) the circuits of the Nile = round about the Nile, Num 11:24 ; Num 11:31 ; Num 11:32 ; Num 35:2 סְבִיבֹתֵיהֶם , Judg 7:18 ; 1Sam 26:5 ; 1Sam 26:7 ; 2Kgs 6:17 סביבֹת אלישׁע , Ps 18:12 ; Ps 27:6 על אֹיְבַי סביבותי , etc.; often idiomatic preceded by אשׁר , as Gen 33:5 הערים אשׁר סביבותיהם Gen 41:48 ; Lev 25:44 ; Num 16:34 ; Deut 6:14 ; Deut 13:8 ; Deut 17:14 ; Deut 21:2 +. In the same sense מִסְּבִיבוֺתָם Ezek 28:26 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5477')\">BDB5477</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5439')\">H5439</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H4036')\">H4036</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H5437')\">H5437</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5476')\">BDB5476</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5478')\">BDB5478</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>סָבִיב</bdbheb><sub>336</sub> <b>substantive</b>, used mostly as <b>adverb</b> and <b>preposition</b>, <highlightword>circuit, round about</highlightword>: — construct <bdbheb>סְבִיב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 3:11\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(30,3,11)\">Amos 3:11</ref> plural construct <bdbheb>סְבִיבֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 32:44\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,44)\">Jer 32:44</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 33:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,13)\">Jer 33:13</ref>, suffix <bdbheb>סְבִיבֶיךָ</bdbheb> etc. (10 t.), much oftener <bdbheb>סְבִיבוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 7:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,24)\">Exod 7:24</ref> + 22 t., <bdbheb>סְבִיבוֺתַי</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>תֶיךָ</bdbheb>-, etc., <ref ref=\"Deut 17:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,17,14)\">Deut 17:14</ref>, etc. (48 t.): — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> in singular — <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> as <b>substantive</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 11:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,11,8)\">1Chr 11:8</ref> <bdbheb>מןהֿמלוא וְעַדהַֿסָּבִיב</bdbheb> and to <highlight>the parts round about</highlight>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> as <b>adverb accusative</b> <bdbheb>סָבִיב</bdbheb> (in) <highlight>a circuit</highlight>, i.e. <highlight>round about</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 23:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,23,17)\">Gen 23:17</ref> <bdbheb>בְּכָלגְּֿבֻלוֺ סָבִיב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 19:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,19,12)\">Exod 19:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 25:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,11)\">Exod 25:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 25:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,24)\">Exod 25:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 25:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,25)\">Exod 25:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 1:5\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(3,1,5)\">Lev 1:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 1:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,1,11)\">Lev 1:11</ref> <bdbheb>עַל הַמִּזְבֵּחַ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>סָבִיב</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Judg 20:29\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,29)\">Judg 20:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 3:1\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(11,3,1)\">1Kgs 3:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:11\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,11)\">1Kgs 5:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 3:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,3,7)\">Ps 3:7</ref> <bdbheb>שָׁתוּ עָלָ֑י</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֲשֶׁר ס</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 12:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,12,9)\">Ps 12:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 34:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,34,8)\">Ps 34:8</ref> + often; sometimes doubled, for the sake of emphasis, <ref ref=\"2Chr 4:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,4,3)\">2Chr 4:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 8:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,8,10)\">Ezek 8:10</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ס</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַל הַקִּיר ס</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ezek 37:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,37,2)\">Ezek 37:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 40:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,40,5)\">Ezek 40:5</ref> and often in Ezek 40-43. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> as <b>preposition</b>: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>a</highlight>) Psalms, <ref ref=\"Amos 3:11\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(30,3,11)\">Amos 3:11</ref> <bdbheb>צַר וּסְבִיב הָאָרֶץ</bdbheb> <highlight>distress</highlight>, and that <highlight>in the circuit of</highlight> (= <highlight>round about</highlight>) the land (but read probably with <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>יְסֹבֵב</bdbheb> <highlight>will encircle</highlight>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>b</highlight>) <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>סָבִיב לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 16:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,13)\">Exod 16:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 40:33\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(2,40,33)\">Exod 40:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 1:50\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"50\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"50\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,50)\">Num 1:50</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 1:53\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"53\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"53\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,53)\">Num 1:53</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 2:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,2,2)\">Num 2:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 7:21\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(7,7,21)\">Judg 7:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:5\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,5)\">1Kgs 6:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:32\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,32)\">1Kgs 18:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:35\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,35)\">1Kgs 18:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 41:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,41,10)\">Ezek 41:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 14:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,14,16)\">Ezek 14:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 19:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,12)\">Job 19:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 34:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,34,8)\">Ps 34:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 78:28\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,28)\">Ps 78:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 125:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"125\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"125\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,125,2)\">Ps 125:2</ref> (twice in verse) <bdbheb>סָבִיב לְעַמּוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 128:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"128\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"128\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,128,3)\">Ps 128:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 3:7\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(22,3,7)\">Song 3:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Nah 3:8\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(34,3,8)\">Nah 3:8</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>c</highlight>) strangely, <bdbheb>סָבִיב אֵת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:5\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,5)\">1Kgs 6:5</ref> (omitted by <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 43:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,43,17)\">Ezek 43:17</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <bdbheb>מִסָּבִיב</bdbheb><sub>42</sub>, <highlight>from round about, from every side</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:33\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,33)\">Ezek 16:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:37\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,37)\">Ezek 16:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 23:22\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(26,23,22)\">Ezek 23:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 37:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(26,37,21)\">Ezek 37:21</ref>, but usually (<bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> <b>1 c</b>) = <highlight>on every side</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Jer 4:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,4,17)\">Jer 4:17</ref> <bdbheb>הָיוּ עָלֶיהָ מִסָּבִיב</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Isa 42:25\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(23,42,25)\">Isa 42:25</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וַתְּלַהֲטֵהוּ מ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Joel 4:11\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(29,4,11)\">Joel 4:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Joel 4:12\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(29,4,12)\">Joel 4:12</ref> Psalms <bdbheb>מָגוֺר מִסָּבִיב</bdbheb> terror <highlight>on every side !</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 6:25\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(24,6,25)\">Jer 6:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 20:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,20,3)\">Jer 20:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 20:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,20,10)\">Jer 20:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 46:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,5)\">Jer 46:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 49:29\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,29)\">Jer 49:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 31:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,14)\">Ps 31:14</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Lam 2:22\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(25,2,22)\">Lam 2:22</ref> especially in the Deuteronomic phrases <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אוֺיְבִים מ</bdbheb>, or <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הֵנִיחַ מ</bdbheb> (sometimes in combination), as <ref ref=\"Deut 12:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,10)\">Deut 12:10</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>והניח לכם מכלאֿויביכם מ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Deut 25:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,25,19)\">Deut 25:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 21:42\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(6,21,42)\">Josh 21:42</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לָהֶם מ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וַיָּנַח י</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Josh 23:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,23,1)\">Josh 23:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 2:14\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(7,2,14)\">Judg 2:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 8:34\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,34)\">Judg 8:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 12:11\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(9,12,11)\">1Sam 12:11</ref> +; <bdbheb>מִסָּבִיב לְ</bdbheb> <highlight>from round about</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Num 16:24\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,24)\">Num 16:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 16:27\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,27)\">Num 16:27</ref>. — On <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:21\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,21)\">1Sam 14:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 24:6\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(10,24,6)\">2Sam 24:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 10:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,10,8)\">Job 10:8</ref> see  <bdbheb><reflink>סָבַב</reflink></bdbheb>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> In <highlight>plur.:</highlight> — <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <bdbheb>סְבִיבִים</bdbheb>: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>a</highlight>) in masculine sense, <highlight>those round about</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Ps 76:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"76\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"76\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,76,12)\">Ps 76:12</ref> <bdbheb>כָּלסְֿבִיבָיו יֹבִילוּ שַׁי</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 89:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,8)\">Ps 89:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 48:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,17)\">Jer 48:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 48:39\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,39)\">Jer 48:39</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>b</highlight>) in neuter sense, <highlight>the parts round about</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Jer 49:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,5)\">Jer 49:5</ref> <bdbheb>מִכָּלסְֿבִיבָ֑יִךְ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>בִּסְבִיבֵי ירושׁלם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 32:44\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,44)\">Jer 32:44</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 33:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,13)\">Jer 33:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 21:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,21,14)\">Jer 21:14</ref> <bdbheb>וְאָֽכְלָה כָּלסְֿבִיבֶיהָ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Jer 46:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,14)\">Jer 46:14</ref> with the force of a <b>perp.</b>, <ref ref=\"Ps 50:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,3)\">Ps 50:3</ref> <bdbheb>וסביביו נשׂערה מאד</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 97:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"97\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"97\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,97,2)\">Ps 97:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 1:17\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(25,1,17)\">Lam 1:17</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>סְבִיבוֺת</bdbheb> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>a</highlight>) as <b>substantive</b> (<grk>α</grk>) <highlight>circuits</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Eccl 1:6\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(21,1,6)\">Eccl 1:6</ref> <bdbheb>ועל סביבותיו שָׁב הָרוּחַ</bdbheb>; (<grk>β</grk>) <highlight>the parts round about</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Num 22:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,22,4)\">Num 22:4</ref> <bdbheb>ילחכו הקהל אתכֿלסְֿבִיבֹתֵינוּ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Jer 17:26\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,26)\">Jer 17:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 50:32\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,32)\">Jer 50:32</ref> (compare <ref ref=\"Jer 21:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,21,14)\">Jer 21:14</ref> above); with reference to their inhabitants, <ref ref=\"Ps 44:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,44,19)\">Ps 44:19</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 79:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"79\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"79\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,79,4)\">Ps 79:4</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לעג וקלס לסב</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:57\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"57\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"57\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,57)\">Ezek 16:57</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 28:24\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(26,28,24)\">Ezek 28:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 9:16\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,16)\">Dan 9:16</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>b</highlight>) with the force a <b>preposition</b> <ref ref=\"Exod 7:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,24)\">Exod 7:24</ref> <bdbheb>סְבִיבֹת הַיְאֹר</bdbheb> literally (in) <highlight>the circuits of</highlight> the Nile = <highlight>round about</highlight> the Nile, <ref ref=\"Num 11:24\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,24)\">Num 11:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 11:31\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,31)\">Num 11:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 11:32\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,32)\">Num 11:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 35:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,35,2)\">Num 35:2</ref> <bdbheb>סְבִיבֹתֵיהֶם</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Judg 7:18\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(7,7,18)\">Judg 7:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 26:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,26,5)\">1Sam 26:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 26:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,26,7)\">1Sam 26:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 6:17\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(12,6,17)\">2Kgs 6:17</ref> <bdbheb>סביבֹת אלישׁע</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 18:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,12)\">Ps 18:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 27:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,27,6)\">Ps 27:6</ref> <bdbheb>על אֹיְבַי סביבותי</bdbheb>, etc.; often idiomatic preceded by <bdbheb>אשׁר</bdbheb>, as <ref ref=\"Gen 33:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,5)\">Gen 33:5</ref> <bdbheb>הערים אשׁר סביבותיהם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 41:48\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,48)\">Gen 41:48</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 25:44\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,44)\">Lev 25:44</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 16:34\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,34)\">Num 16:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 6:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,6,14)\">Deut 6:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 13:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,13,8)\">Deut 13:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 17:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,17,14)\">Deut 17:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 21:2\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(5,21,2)\">Deut 21:2</ref> +. In the same sense <bdbheb>מִסְּבִיבוֺתָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 28:26\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(26,28,26)\">Ezek 28:26</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Amos 3:11", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 3, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Jer 32:44", "book": "JER", "chapter": 32, "verse": 44}, {"raw": "Jer 33:13", "book": "JER", "chapter": 33, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Exod 7:24", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 7, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Deut 17:14", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 17, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "1Chr 11:8", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 11, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Gen 23:17", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 23, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Exod 19:12", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 19, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Exod 25:11", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 25, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Exod 25:24", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 25, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Exod 25:25", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 25, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Lev 1:5", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 1, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Lev 1:11", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 1, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Judg 20:29", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 20, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "1Kgs 3:1", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 3, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "1Kgs 5:11", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 5, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Ps 3:7", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 3, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Ps 12:9", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 12, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ps 34:8", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 34, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "2Chr 4:3", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 4, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ezek 8:10", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 8, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Ezek 37:2", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 37, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ezek 40:5", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 40, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Exod 16:13", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 16, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Exod 40:33", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 40, "verse": 33}, {"raw": "Num 1:50", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 1, "verse": 50}, {"raw": "Num 1:53", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 1, "verse": 53}, {"raw": "Num 2:2", "book": "